<title>USA: Carolina First settles lawsuits.</title>
<headline>Carolina First settles lawsuits.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, S.C. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carolina First Corp said Tuesday that is settled two lawsuits involving former officers and shareholders of Midlands National Bank, bank which merged with Carolina First in 1995.</p>
<p>Carolina First said that the settlement agreement prohibited it from disclosing its terms.</p>
<p>One of the lawsuits was brought by the former officers against Carolina First and alleged breach of employment contracts.</p>
<p>The other lawsuit was brought by Carolina First against the former officers and alleged bank fraud and securities fraud in connection with the merger.</p>
</text>
